# Akul the Unrepentant: with only two other creatures the ability can't be activated (Akul is not "other"); with three it
# can, but only as a sorcery (CR 602.5d: not at the beginning of combat). Sacrificing Memnite, Ornithopter and Phyrexian
# Walker puts Colossal Dreadmaw from hand onto the battlefield (not cast, CR 608.2d).
# Akul the Unrepentant {B}{B}{R}{R}: Legendary Creature — Scorpion Dragon Rogue 5/5
#   Flying, trample
#   Sacrifice three other creatures: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. Activate only as a
#   sorcery and only once each turn.

